    "detailed_description": "<strong>Octave</strong> is a point 'n click horror-adventure game with elements of action and quest.<br><br>   You play the role of a guy who happens to be in the wrong place at the wrong time. You are dragged into a dark forest, but on the verge of death, you are mysteriously saved from your killer by a someone or something. <br>   As you venture deeper into the woods you find yourself surrounded by atrocity. You realise that salvation can turn out to be a real nightmare. All the way through fear you seek out the mysteries of the dark forest. <br>   The struggle for life has only just begun!<br><br><strong>In the game you will see:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>an atmospheric dark forest with creepy shadows and monsters<br>    </li><li>an old house full of puzzles and paranormal activities<br>    </li><li>the underworld, where you have to run a lot</li></ul>",
